@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# 참석·식사 항목은 관리자 시간표에서 collectParticipation으로 관리합니다.
# 생성·수정 예시는 07-schedule-domain.http를 참고합니다.

### Public active options used by registration and self update
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/participation-options

### Internal option projection and participant counts used by operations views
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/participation-options
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
